# deliver_the_big_blue — "Investigate the Weird Vape" (Quest 4, part 2 of 2)
#
# The delivery half of the owner's "Quest 4". Split from investigate_weird_vape because the Big
# Blue could only enter the bag as that quest's reward (dialogue cannot hand over an item). Take
# the Big Blue to Scrap Man, hear what he knows, report back to Daniel.
#
# GRANTED BY: Daniel's brew choice at the end of investigate_weird_vape
# (quests/dialogue/danielpauls.quest, node iwv_deliver).
# COMPLETED BY: Daniel's report choice (danielpauls.quest, node dbb_chat), which also grants Quest
# 5 (wtf_mosley).
#
# After this quest completes, Scrap Man's Sell shop unlocks — a MERCHANT choice on his NODE start
# gated  GATE: complete deliver_the_big_blue  (quests/dialogue/scrapman.quest).

QUEST deliver_the_big_blue
TITLE: Investigate the Weird Vape
GIVER: Daniel Pauls
LOCATION: Scrap Man's place, southeast of London.

# Stage 0 — deliver the Big Blue. Scrap Man's dialogue consumes it and reveals what he knows.
# Intermediate TalkTo: it advances on the interact, so the report stage below only opens after you
# have been to Scrap Man. (If the player interacts without the Big Blue, the reveal branch greys
# but the stage still advances — a minor gap, not a soft-lock; big_blue is a quest item.)
STAGE TALKTO scrapman
OBJECTIVE: Take the Big Blue to Scrap Man.

# Stage 1 (last) — MANUAL, completed by Daniel's report dialogue. Not TalkTo: a TalkTo last stage
# completes on the interact, before Daniel says a word.
STAGE MANUAL
OBJECTIVE: Get back to Daniel Paul with what Scrap Man said.

# "Here's your cash, sorted for the info." — owner's chosen payout.
REWARD
POUNDS: 30
XP: 60
